  "description": "PITTET crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H84 Dy3 N8 Ni2 O16 1+,2(C1 H4 O1),Cl1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.202-3.861 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.63-114.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni2Dy3(LH)4]Cl·3CH3OH.",
